#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:2
msgid "Setting up the development environment"
msgstr "إعداد بيئة التطوير"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:4
msgid ""
"You need three things on the host before you can compile: an editor (VS Code"
" is recommended because the debugger plugs into it), a Linux-flavored shell "
"(WSL on Windows, native on Linux/macOS), and the OpenMV repository with the "
"pinned SDK extracted."
msgstr ""
"تحتاج إلى ثلاثة أشياء على المضيف قبل أن تتمكن من التصريف: محرّر (يُنصح بـ VS"
" Code لأن المصحِّح يندمج معه)، وصدفة بنكهة Linux (WSL على Windows، وأصلية "
"على Linux/macOS)، ومستودع OpenMV مع استخراج الـ SDK المثبَّت إصداره."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:10
msgid "VS Code"
msgstr "VS Code"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:12
msgid ""
"Any editor works for firmware development -- the build is just ``make``, and"
" the on-hardware debugger runs from the command line too. **Visual Studio "
"Code** is simply the easiest path: the :doc:`debugging` setup plugs into its"
" **Cortex-Debug** extension, so with VS Code installed the rest of these "
"pages work out of the box, building and debugging alike."
msgstr ""
"أي محرّر يصلح لتطوير البرنامج الثابت -- فالبناء ما هو إلا ``make``\\ ، "
"ومصحِّح الأخطاء على العتاد يعمل من سطر الأوامر أيضًا. إن **Visual Studio "
"Code** هو ببساطة أسهل مسار: إذ يندمج إعداد :doc:`debugging` مع امتداده "
"**Cortex-Debug**\\ ، فبتثبيت VS Code تعمل بقية هذه الصفحات مباشرةً، بناءً "
"وتصحيحًا على حدٍّ سواء."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:19
msgid "Installing VS Code"
msgstr "تثبيت VS Code"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Windows** -- download the installer from `code.visualstudio.com "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com>`__ and run it. Install VS Code on "
"**Windows**, not inside WSL; it integrates with WSL through the *WSL* "
"extension, running its UI on Windows while the compiler, files, and debugger"
" live in Linux."
msgstr ""
"**Windows** -- نزّل المُثبِّت من `code.visualstudio.com "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com>`__ وشغّله. ثبّت VS Code على **Windows**\\ ، "
"لا داخل WSL؛ فهو يتكامل مع WSL عبر امتداد *WSL*\\ ، مُشغّلًا واجهته على "
"Windows بينما يعيش المُصرِّف والملفات ومصحِّح الأخطاء في Linux."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:26
msgid ""
"**macOS** -- download the ``.zip`` from `code.visualstudio.com "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com>`__, unzip it, and drag *Visual Studio "
"Code.app* into ``/Applications``. Or ``brew install --cask visual-studio-"
"code``."
msgstr ""
"**macOS** -- نزّل ملف ``.zip`` من `code.visualstudio.com "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com>`__\\ ، وفُكّ ضغطه، واسحب *Visual Studio "
"Code.app* إلى ``/Applications``\\ . أو ``brew install --cask visual-studio-"
"code``\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Linux** -- install the ``.deb`` / ``.rpm`` from `code.visualstudio.com "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com>`__ (e.g. ``sudo apt install ./code_*.deb``),"
" or use the distribution's Snap/Flatpak."
msgstr ""
"**Linux** -- ثبّت ملف ``.deb`` / ``.rpm`` من `code.visualstudio.com "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com>`__ (مثل ``sudo apt install ./code_*.deb``\\ "
")، أو استخدم Snap/Flatpak الخاص بتوزيعتك."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:34
msgid ""
"Extensions to install (from the Extensions panel, :kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+X`):"
msgstr "امتدادات يجب تثبيتها (من لوحة الامتدادات، :kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+X`\\ ):"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:36
msgid ""
"**C/C++** (``ms-vscode.cpptools``) -- C source navigation and IntelliSense."
msgstr ""
"**C/C++** (\\ ``ms-vscode.cpptools``\\ ) -- التنقل في مصدر C وIntelliSense."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Cortex-Debug** (``marus25.cortex-debug``) -- on-chip debugging via GDB and"
" a J-Link / OpenOCD server. Required for :doc:`debugging`."
msgstr ""
"**Cortex-Debug** (\\ ``marus25.cortex-debug``\\ ) -- التصحيح على الشريحة عبر"
" GDB وخادم J-Link / OpenOCD. مطلوب لـ :doc:`debugging`\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:40
msgid ""
"**WSL** (``ms-vscode-remote.remote-wsl``) -- **Windows only**. Lets VS Code "
"open a folder *inside* your WSL distribution so the editor, terminal, "
"IntelliSense, and Cortex-Debug all operate in Linux. Install the C/C++ and "
"Cortex-Debug extensions *into the WSL host* once connected (VS Code prompts "
"for this)."
msgstr ""
"**WSL** (\\ ``ms-vscode-remote.remote-wsl``\\ ) -- **على Windows فقط**\\ . "
"يتيح لـ VS Code فتح مجلد *داخل* توزيعة WSL لديك بحيث يعمل المحرّر والطرفية "
"وIntelliSense وCortex-Debug كلها في Linux. ثبّت امتدادي C/C++ وCortex-Debug "
"*في مضيف WSL* بمجرد الاتصال (يطالبك VS Code بذلك)."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:47
msgid "Host shell"
msgstr "صدفة المضيف"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:49
msgid ""
"You need a Linux (x86-64) or macOS (arm64) environment with ``git`` and a "
"few basic tools. Pick the section for your OS."
msgstr ""
"تحتاج إلى بيئة Linux (x86-64) أو macOS (arm64) مع ``git`` وبعض الأدوات "
"الأساسية. اختر القسم الخاص بنظام التشغيل لديك."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:53
msgid "Windows: install WSL"
msgstr "Windows: تثبيت WSL"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:55
msgid ""
"WSL runs a genuine Ubuntu userland on Windows. After it is installed, every "
"later instruction in this guide is identical to native Linux."
msgstr ""
"يُشغّل WSL مساحة مستخدم Ubuntu حقيقية على Windows. بعد تثبيته، تصبح كل "
"تعليمة لاحقة في هذا الدليل مطابقة لـ Linux الأصلي."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:58
msgid ""
"Open **PowerShell as Administrator** (right-click Start -> *Terminal "
"(Admin)*)."
msgstr ""
"افتح **PowerShell كمسؤول** (انقر بزر الفأرة الأيمن على Start -> *Terminal "
"(Admin)*\\ )."

